## Summary Table: Key FAISS Concepts

| Concept | What It Is | Key Parameter |
|---------|-----------|---------------|
| `dim` | Vector dimensionality | Must match embedding model |
| `IndexFlatL2` | Exact search, 100% recall | Best for <50k vectors |
| `IndexIVFFlat` | Approx search using clustering | `nlist` (#clusters), `nprobe` (#cells to search) |
| `IndexIVFPQ` | Compressed approx search | `m` (subvectors), `bits` (centroids) |
| `train()` | Clustering step for IVF indexes | Must call before `add()` |
| `search()` | Find k nearest neighbors | Returns (distances, indices) |
| `nprobe` | Accuracy/speed tradeoff | Larger = slower but more accurate |

